Read live-session-controller.ts / orb-live.ts to confirm POST
/api/v1/orb/live/session/start + GET /api/v1/orb/live/stream is a plain
HTTPS request/SSE pair (not a WebSocket upgrade), and that GET
/live/stream's connectToLiveAPI() call is what actually opens the real
Nova connection carrying the full assembled system instruction (guided-
topic block included) — confirmed via `router.get('/live/stream', ...)`
at orb-live.ts:15382, `connectToLiveAPI(...)` call at :15544.

