## Root-cause narrowing

Read the full buildGuidedTopicNarrationBlock source (all 4 branches).
Found a phrase common to literally all 4 (and unique to the guided-topic
path — never present in an ordinary session's system instruction, which
succeeds at the ~36% ambient baseline, not 100%):

  DE: "...hat Vorrang vor JEDER generischen Begrüßungs- oder
       Eröffnungsregel."
  EN: "...OVERRIDES every generic greeting/opening rule."

An "overrides/takes precedence over every other rule" assertion is
structurally the same shape as a prompt-injection/jailbreak directive.

## Fix applied

Edited src/orb/live/instruction/guided-topic-narration-prompt.ts — removed
the override/precedence clause from all 4 branches, kept the operative
intent (language pin + whole-session scope) as a plain declarative.

$ npx tsc --noEmit
(clean, exit 0)

